# Build context for the API and storefront images (GCP plan B1). The images
# need the workspace manifests (npm ci validates the lockfile against every
# workspace), the API, the shared package, the storefront and legal/ — and
# never anything local: env files, uploads, logs, dumps, build output.
# Later lines win, so the never-ship rules come last.

# Every app's contents are excluded except its package.json (workspace
# manifest); the API and the storefront come whole. (Written as apps/*/*
# rather than apps/* so gcloud's ignore rules, which cannot re-include a file
# inside an excluded folder, read it the same way Docker does.)
apps/*/*
!apps/*/package.json
!apps/api/*
!apps/storefront/*
apps/api/scratch
apps/api/_m.ts

packages/shared-ui
deploy
scripts
.git
.github
.claude
*.md
!legal/*.md

# Never shipped, wherever they are.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vercel
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/uploads
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/*.dump
